Round $54.\overline{54}$ to the nearest hundredth.

The repeating decimal $54.\overline{54}$ is $54.545454...$. To round to the nearest hundredth, we look at the thousandths digit, which is 5. Since this digit is 5 or greater, we round the hundredths digit up from 4 to 5.

